cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper and the software."
title: "Denial of Service as a First-Class MCP Security Property: A Threat Model, Measurement Harness, and Empirical Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained threat model, CWE-grounded taxonomy of seven Model Context
  Protocol (MCP) denial-of-service vectors, a reproducible measurement harness,
  and an empirical evaluation combining replicated real smoke-test measurements
  (mean +/- 95% CI) with an explicitly labeled synthetic full-sweep
  extrapolation, against the official Python and TypeScript MCP SDKs.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The MCP-DoS-Paper Authors"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-16"
license: MIT
keywords:
